22: <main class="shell" aria-label="Last Light survival game">
23:   <header class="topline"><div class="brand">LAST <i>LIGHT</i></div><div class="sys"><span>SECTOR 09</span><span class="signal">SIGNAL WEAK</span></div></header>
24:   <section class="scene-wrap" aria-label="Scrolling wasteland journey">
