30:     <div class="stat food"><div class="stat-head"><span class="stat-name"><span class="stat-icon">✚</span>RATIONS</span><span class="stat-value" id="foodVal">64%</span></div><div class="bar"><div class="fill" id="foodBar"></div></div><div class="bar-foot"><span>PROVISIONS</span><span>12 DAYS</span></div></div>
31:     <div class="stat health"><div class="stat-head"><span class="stat-name"><span class="stat-icon">♥</span>HULL</span><span class="stat-value" id="healthVal">86%</span></div><div class="bar"><div class="fill" id="healthBar"></div></div><div class="bar-foot"><span>CREW VITALS</span><span>STABLE</span></div></div>
32:     <div class="stat scrap"><div class="stat-head"><span class="stat-name"><span class="stat-icon">◇</span>SCRAP</span><span class="stat-value" id="scrapVal">0</span></div><div class="scrap-readout">FIELD SALVAGE</div><div class="bar-foot"><span>MARKET</span><span>1.2 / MI</span></div></div>
33:   </section>
34:   <section class="crew-roster" aria-label="Crew health statuses"><div class="crew-heading"><span>CREW VITALS</span><span id="crewCount">3 / 3 ACTIVE</span></div><div class="crew-list" id="crewList"></div></section>
35:   <section class="dashboard"><div class="readout"><small>ODOMETER</small><strong><span id="distance">00.0</span><em> mi</em></strong><div class="progress"><span id="progress"></span></div></div><div class="log"><small>ROAD LOG / <span id="logTime">DAY 01</span></small><span id="logText">The engine coughs to life. Keep moving.</span></div><div class="readout" style="text-align:right"><small>DESTINATION</small><strong>100<em> mi</em></strong><div class="progress"><span style="width:100%;background:#556057"></span></div></div></section>
36:   <section class="scavenge-dock"><button class="scavenge-launch" id="scavengeLaunch" type="button"><span>☄ &nbsp; SCAVENGE</span><small>STOP THE VAN · HUNT MUTANT DRONES · 10 SEC</small></button><button class="camp-button" id="campButton" type="button"><span>⌂ &nbsp; MAKE CAMP</span><small>PAUSE · 15 RATIONS · RESTORE SKILLS</small></button></section>
37:   <footer class="footer"><span>WASTELAND SURVIVAL PROTOCOL v.09</span><span id="status">▶&nbsp; EN ROUTE</span></footer>
38:   <div class="card-shade" id="eventShade" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="eventTitle"><article class="event-card"><div class="event-kicker" id="eventKicker">DISTRESS SIGNAL / 4 MI AHEAD</div><h2 class="event-title" id="eventTitle">—</h2><p class="event-desc" id="eventDesc"></p><div class="crew-event" id="crewEvent"></div><div class="choices" id="choices"></div><div class="event-tip">CHOOSE CAREFULLY. EVERY MILE COSTS SOMETHING. &nbsp; [1] / [2] / [3]</div></article></div>
39:   <div class="card-shade market-shade" id="marketShade" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="marketTitle"><article class="market-card"><div class="market-kicker">NEON BAZAAR / ROAD STOP</div><h2 class="event-title" id="marketTitle">SCRAP MARKET</h2><p class="event-desc" id="marketDesc">The van rolls to a stop beneath the market's neon signs. Trade field salvage for supplies.</p><div class="market-balance">AVAILABLE SCRAP <strong id="marketScrap">0</strong></div><div class="market-trades"><button class="market-trade" id="buyFuel"><span>FUEL CANISTER <small>+20 FUEL</small></span><strong>8 SCRAP</strong></button><button class="market-trade" id="buyRations"><span>RATION CRATE <small>+20 RATIONS</small></span><strong>8 SCRAP</strong></button><button class="market-trade" id="buyMedkit"><span>MEDKIT <small id="medkitEffect">+35 CREW VITALS</small></span><strong>12 SCRAP</strong></button></div><button class="market-leave" id="leaveMarket">LEAVE MARKET →</button><div class="event-tip">SALVAGE +1.2 SCRAP PER MILE · NEXT MARKET IN 25 MI</div></article></div>
40:   <div class="card-shade scavenge-shade" id="scavengeShade" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="scavengeTitle"><article class="scavenge-card"><div class="scavenge-kicker">FIELD OPERATION / LIVE FIRE</div><h2 class="event-title" id="scavengeTitle">DRONE SCRAMBLE</h2><p class="event-desc">Tap the mutant drones to shoot them down. Each hit stashes <strong>+2 FUEL · +2 RATIONS · +2 SCRAP</strong>. Travel is paused.</p><div class="scavenge-hud"><span>TIME <strong id="scavengeTimer">10</strong></span><span>DRONES HIT <strong id="scavengeHits">0</strong></span></div><div class="drone-field" id="droneField" aria-label="Tap a floating mutant drone to shoot"><button class="drone-target" type="button" aria-label="Shoot mutant drone"><span class="drone-core">✹</span></button><button class="drone-target" type="button" aria-label="Shoot mutant drone"><span class="drone-core">✹</span></button><button class="drone-target" type="button" aria-label="Shoot mutant drone"><span class="drone-core">✹</span></button><div class="drone-scanline"></div></div><p class="scavenge-result" id="scavengeResult" aria-live="polite">TAP THE DRONES BEFORE THE TIMER RUNS OUT.</p><button class="scavenge-return" id="scavengeReturn" type="button" disabled>RETURN TO ROAD →</button></article></div>
41:   <div class="ending" id="ending"><div class="ending-inner"><h2 id="endTitle"></h2><p id="endText"></p><button class="restart" id="restart">↻&nbsp; DRIVE AGAIN</button></div></div>
42:   <div class="toast" id="toast"></div>
43: </main>
